       [ ](https://www.espocrm.com/)  [](https://www.facebook.com/EspoCRM/ "Facebook")[](https://x.com/espocrm "X")   Hi there,

 We are excited to announce that Sales Pack 4.0 is officially out. This release is a major leap that brings even more ERP capabilities into EspoCRM and improves your sales, purchase, and financial operations.

 If you've ever wished your CRM could handle the financial side of your sales and purchases as smoothly as it handles your leads and pipeline, this is the update you've been waiting for.

**Here’s a quick look at what’s new:**

- **Subscriptions** to invoice customers on a recurring basis with proration support;
- **True multi-currency** to track foreign exchange gains/losses on every payment;
- **Supplier bills** & credits to manage vendor invoices alongside your own;
- A brand-new tax engine with **tax codes** and **tax-inclusive pricing**;
- **Issuance locking** to lock issued invoices to keep balance reports correct;
- **Write-Offs** to easily clear small outstanding balances;
- **13 native financial reports** that cover various metrics.

On top of that, we've added dozens of improvements across invoicing, inventory, warehousing, and product management functionality.

Read the full release notes here: <https://www.espocrm.com/blog/sales-pack-v4-0-released/>

Before updating, make sure you're running EspoCRM v9.2+ and back up your database first. If you're updating from v3.1, use the CLI installer for a better experience.

